56
00:04:43,850 --> 00:04:47,970
We will move on to part three
formal writing style.

57
00:04:53,090 --> 00:04:57,690
Firstly, we're going to talk about
informal language in formal language

58
00:04:57,690 --> 00:05:03,930
or words that are too simple.
For example big go do,

59
